    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Walk in Community with the Animal World</p></blockquote><p>Barbarians who follow the Path of the Wild Heart see themselves as kin to animals. They learn magical ways to speak with animals, and their Rage strengthens that bond as it fills them with supernatural might.</p><h3>Path of the Wild Heart Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.MnEpFdo1kSvMucYN]{Animal Speaker}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.qWCVhn4gbuA4FYnf]{Rage of the Wilds}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.WMpdFonpFAkA5Yzl]{Aspect of the Wilds}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.iBACbBA11h7bzE72]{Nature Speaker}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.7keD3j6WrmCHRacF]{Power of the Wilds}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
